<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <header class="bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-md sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="bg-white/10 p-2.5 rounded-xl">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cube text-xl text-indigo-200"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="font-bold text-lg leading-tight">DimensionalCraft</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-indigo-200">PjBL, GeoGebra & Sumber Belajar Komprehensif • Kelas XII SMA</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-6 text-sm font-medium">
                <button onclick="switchTab('materi')" id="nav-materi" class="text-white border-b-2 border-white pb-1 transition">Materi & Teori Mendalam</button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('visualizer')" id="nav-visualizer" class="text-indigo-200 hover:text-white pb-1 transition">Simulasi 3D Ruang</button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('referensi')" id="nav-referensi" class="text-indigo-200 hover:text-white pb-1 transition">Referensi & Literatur</button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('proyek')" id="nav-proyek" class="text-indigo-200 hover:text-white pb-1 transition">Panduan Proyek</button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('ai')" id="nav-ai" class="text-indigo-200 hover:text-white pb-1 transition"><i class="fa-solid fa-robot mr-1"></i> Asisten AI Pintar</button>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Left 2 Cols: Dynamic Content Viewer -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">

            <!-- TAB 1: MATERI LENGKAP & DETAIL DENGAN ILUSTRASI -->
            <section id="tab-materi" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 space-y-6">
                <div class="border-b pb-4">
                    <span class="bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Modul Pembelajaran Mandiri Terlengkap (Fase F)</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2">Geometri Ruang: Kedudukan, Proyeksi, Jarak, Sudut, & Trik Akselerasi</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Panduan teoretis analitis mendalam disertai penjabaran rumus, segitiga penolong, sudut ruang, dan contoh soal terstruktur.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                    
                    <!-- Bab 1: Kedudukan Objek & Proyeksi Ortogonal -->
                    <div class="p-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-4">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-compass text-indigo-600 mr-2"></i>1. Kedudukan Lengkap Titik, Garis, dan Bidang dalam Ruang
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs">Memahami kedudukan spasial antarobjek secara sistematis adalah fondasi utama sebelum menentukan jarak maupun sudut:</p>
                        
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs pt-1">
                            <!-- Kedudukan Titik -->
                            <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5 shadow-sm">
                                <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 block text-xs"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-dot mr-1 text-indigo-500"></i> A. Kedudukan Titik</span>
                                <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
                                    <li><strong>Titik ke Titik:</strong> Berimpit (memiliki koordinat sama) atau Berbeda (terpisah jarak).</li>
                                    <li><strong>Titik ke Garis:</strong> Titik <em>terletak pada</em> garis atau <em>di luar</em> garis.</li>
                                    <li><strong>Titik ke Bidang:</strong> Titik <em>terletak pada</em> bidang atau <em>di luar</em> bidang.</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Kedudukan Garis -->
                            <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5 shadow-sm">
                                <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 block text-xs"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-alt-h mr-1 text-indigo-500"></i> B. Kedudukan Garis ke Garis</span>
                                <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
                                    <li><strong>Sejajar:</strong> Sebidang dan tidak berpotongan.</li>
                                    <li><strong>Berpotongan:</strong> Sebidang dan bertemu di 1 titik.</li>
                                    <li><strong>Bersilangan:</strong> Tidak sebidang dan tidak pernah berpotongan (misal: rusuk \(AB\) dan \(CG\)).</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Garis & Titik ke Bidang -->
                            <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5 shadow-sm">
                                <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 block text-xs"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group mr-1 text-indigo-500"></i> C. Garis & Titik terhadap Bidang</span>
                                <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
                                    <li><strong>Garis Terletak pada Bidang:</strong> Semua titik pada garis berada di bidang.</li>
                                    <li><strong>Garis Sejajar Bidang:</strong> Garis tak punya titik tembus dengan bidang.</li>
                                    <li><strong>Garis Memotong/Menembus Bidang:</strong> Memiliki 1 titik tembus (\(90^\circ\) jika tegak lurus).</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Proyeksi Ortogonal Teorema -->
                        <div class="p-3 bg-indigo-50/70 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100 text-xs text-indigo-950 space-y-1">
                            <span class="font-bold text-indigo-900 block"><i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project mr-1 text-indigo-600"></i> Proyeksi Ortogonal & Teorema 3 Tegak Lurus:</span>
                            <p class="text-slate-700">Proyeksi titik \(P\) ke garis/bidang \(\alpha\) adalah titik tembus \(P'\) sedemikian hingga ruas garis \(PP'\) tegak lurus (\(90^\circ\)) terhadap target. Jika garis \(g \perp \text{bidang } \alpha\) dan garis \(h\) terletak pada \(\alpha\), maka garis yang sejajar proyeksi \(g\) akan tegak lurus terhadap \(h\).</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Bab 2: Konsep Jarak & Segitiga Penolong (Rapi & Sistematis) -->
                    <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-50/70 to-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-100/80 space-y-5 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-indigo-100 pb-3">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-indigo-950 text-base flex items-center">
                                <span class="bg-indigo-600 text-white w-7 h-7 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xs mr-2 shadow-sm font-bold">2</span>
                                Analisis Jarak & Metode Segitiga Penolong
                            </h3>
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Kunci Akselerasi Soal</span>
                        </div>

                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                            <strong>Prinsip Utama:</strong> Jarak dari titik ke suatu objek (titik, garis, atau bidang) adalah panjang <strong>ruas garis terpendek</strong> yang ditarik dari titik tersebut secara <strong>tegak lurus (\(90^\circ\))</strong> terhadap objek target.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Workflow 3 Langkah Emas -->
                        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 space-y-3 shadow-sm">
                            <span class="font-bold text-xs text-indigo-900 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-route text-indigo-600 mr-2"></i>3 Langkah Emas Menghitung Jarak Titik ke Garis:
                            </span>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
                                <div class="bg-indigo-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100/60">
                                    <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 block text-[11px] mb-1">Langkah 1: Hubungkan Titik</span>
                                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11px]">Hubungkan titik acuan ke kedua ujung garis target hingga terbentuk sebuah <strong>segitiga penolong</strong>.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-indigo-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100/60">
                                    <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 block text-[11px] mb-1">Langkah 2: Hitung Sisi Segitiga</span>
                                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11px]">Cari panjang ketiga sisi segitiga penolong tersebut menggunakan Teorema Pythagoras atau diagonal.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-indigo-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100/60">
                                    <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 block text-[11px] mb-1">Langkah 3: Terapkan Formula Tipe</span>
                                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11px]">Identifikasi jenis segitiga (Siku-siku, Sama Kaki, atau Sembarang) lalu gunakan formula khasnya.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Classification Grid of Triangles -->
                        <div class="space-y-3">
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs block">Klasifikasi Formula Segitiga Penolong (Pilih Sesuai Bentuk):</span>
                            
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                                <!-- Tipe A: Segitiga Siku-Siku -->
                                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 shadow-sm space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between">
                                    <div>
                                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                                            <span class="font-bold text-emerald-800 text-xs flex items-center">
                                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play mr-1.5 rotate-90 text-emerald-600"></i> Tipe A: Siku-Siku
                                            </span>
                                            <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Kesamaan Luas</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11px] leading-relaxed mb-2">
                                            Berlaku jika salah satu sudut segitiga penolong bernilai tepat \(90^\circ\).
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="bg-emerald-50/80 p-3 rounded-lg text-center border border-emerald-100 space-y-1">
                                        <p class="text-[10px] text-emerald-700 font-semibold uppercase">Rumus Jarak Tinggi (\(t\))</p>
                                        <p class="font-bold text-emerald-950 font-mono text-sm">
                                            \(t = \frac{\text{alas} \times \text{tinggi}}{\text{hipotenusa}} = \frac{a \cdot b}{c}\)
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Tipe B: Sama Kaki / Sama Sisi -->
                                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200 shadow-sm space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between">
                                    <div>
                                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                                            <span class="font-bold text-indigo-800 text-xs flex items-center">
                                                <i class="fa-solid fa-caret-up mr-1.5 text-indigo-600"></i> Tipe B: Sama Kaki / Sisi
                                            </span>
                                            <span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Proyeksi Tengah</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11px] leading-relaxed mb-2">
                                            Proyeksi titik jatuh tepat di pertengahan alas (\(x = \frac{1}{2}\text{alas}\)).
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="bg-indigo-50/80 p-3 rounded-lg text-center border border-indigo-100 space-y-1">
                                        <p class="text-[10px] text-indigo-700 font-semibold uppercase">Rumus Jarak Tinggi (\(t\))</p>
                                        <p class="font-bold text-indigo-950 font-mono text-sm">
                                            \(t = \sqrt{\text{sisi miring}^2 - \left(\frac{\text{alas}}{2}\right)^2}\)
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Tipe C: Segitiga Sembarang -->
                                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between">
                                    <div>
                                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                                            <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 text-xs flex items-center">
                                                <i class="fa-solid fa-draw-polygon mr-1.5 text-amber-600"></i> Tipe C: Sembarang
                                            </span>
                                            <span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Aturan Cosinus</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11px] leading-relaxed mb-2">
                                            Ketiga sisi segitiga memiliki panjang yang berbeda. Gunakan Aturan Cosinus.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="bg-amber-50/80 p-3 rounded-lg text-center border border-amber-100 space-y-1">
                                        <p class="text-[10px] text-amber-800 font-semibold uppercase">Tahap 1: Trigonometri</p>
                                        <p class="font-bold text-amber-950 font-mono text-xs">
                                            \(\cos \theta = \frac{a^2 + b^2 - c^2}{2ab}\)
                                        </p>
                                        <p class="text-[10px] text-amber-700 pt-0.5">\(\rightarrow t = a \cdot \sin \theta\)</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Bab 3: Konsep Sudut dalam Dimensi Tiga (Format Kartu Rapi) -->
                    <div class="p-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-2">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base flex items-center">
                                <span class="bg-indigo-600 text-white w-7 h-7 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xs mr-2 shadow-sm font-bold">3</span>
                                Konsep Sudut dalam Dimensi Tiga
                            </h3>
                            <span class="text-xs text-indigo-600 font-semibold">Representasi Geometris</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
                            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 space-y-2 shadow-sm hover:border-indigo-300 transition">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-indigo-700 font-bold">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-split-up-and-left text-sm"></i>
                                    <span>A. Sudut Dua Garis Bersilangan</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                                    Geser salah satu garis hingga <strong>berpotongan</strong> dengan garis lainnya tanpa mengubah arahnya (tetap sejajar). Sudut yang terbentuk di titik potong adalah besar sudut bersilangan.
                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 space-y-2 shadow-sm hover:border-indigo-300 transition">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-indigo-700 font-bold">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-sm"></i>
                                    <span>B. Sudut Garis ke Bidang</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                                    Sudut antara garis \(g\) dengan garis proyeksinya \(g'\) pada bidang tersebut (\(\theta = \angle(g, g')\)). Proyeksi dibuat dengan menarik garis tegak lurus dari ujung garis ke bidang.
                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 space-y-2 shadow-sm hover:border-indigo-300 transition">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-indigo-700 font-bold">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open text-sm"></i>
                                    <span>C. Sudut Dua Bidang (Dihidral)</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                                    Tentukan garis potong (tumpuan) kedua bidang. Tarik masing-masing 1 garis pada tiap bidang yang <strong>tegak lurus</strong> terhadap garis tumpuan di titik yang sama.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Bab 4: Cheat Sheet & Formula Trik Akselerasi pada Kubus -->
                    <div class="p-5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500/10 via-amber-50/50 to-orange-500/10 rounded-xl border border-amber-300/60 space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-200 pb-2">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-950 text-base flex items-center">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-amber-500 mr-2 text-lg"></i>4. Formula Cepat Akselerasi Kubus (Rusuk = \(s\))
                            </h3>
                            <span class="bg-amber-200/80 text-amber-900 text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">Shortcut UTBK / SNBT</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
                            <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-1">
                                <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-[11px] block text-amber-900"><i class="fa-solid fa-border-all mr-1 text-amber-600"></i> Diagonal Sisi & Ruang</span>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Diagonal Sisi = \(s\sqrt{2}\)</p>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Diagonal Ruang = \(s\sqrt{3}\)</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-1">
                                <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-[11px] block text-amber-900"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-to-dot mr-1 text-amber-600"></i> Sudut Dekat ke Bidang</span>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Jarak titik sudut dekat (misal \(E\)) ke bidang diagonal \(AFH\):</p>
                                <p class="font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold text-xs bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded inline-block">\(d = \frac{1}{3}s\sqrt{3}\)</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-1">
                                <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-[11px] block text-amber-900"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-split-up-and-left mr-1 text-amber-600"></i> Sudut Jauh ke Bidang</span>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Jarak titik sudut jauh (misal \(C\)) ke bidang diagonal \(AFH\):</p>
                                <p class="font-mono text-indigo-700 font-bold text-xs bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded inline-block">\(d = \frac{2}{3}s\sqrt{3}\)</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-1">
                                <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-[11px] block text-amber-900"><i class="fa-solid fa-ruler mr-1 text-amber-600"></i> Titik Tengah Rusuk</span>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Jarak titik sudut ke pertengahan rusuk seberang:</p>
                                <p class="font-mono text-amber-700 font-bold text-xs bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded inline-block">\(d = \frac{3}{2}s\)</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Bab 5: Contoh Soal & Pembahasan Runtut dan Jelas -->
                    <div class="p-6 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl space-y-5 shadow-lg border border-slate-800">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-indigo-300 text-base flex items-center">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-indigo-400 mr-2 text-lg"></i>5. Bedah Contoh Soal & Pembahasan Step-by-Step
                            </h3>
                            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-500/30">Langkah Analitis Runtut</span>
                        </div>
                        
                        <!-- Soal 1 -->
                        <div class="bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/80 overflow-hidden text-xs">
                            <div class="bg-slate-800 px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-700 flex justify-between items-center">
                                <span class="font-bold text-indigo-300 text-xs flex items-center">
                                    <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 text-slate-950 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] mr-2 font-bold">1</span>
                                    Jarak titik ke titik — diagonal ruang
                                </span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Kubus</span>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="p-4 space-y-3">
                                <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium leading-relaxed bg-slate-900/60 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                                    <strong>Soal:</strong> Kubus \(ABCD.EFGH\) memiliki panjang rusuk \(6\text{ cm}\). Tentukan jarak titik \(A\) ke titik \(G\).
                                </p>

                                <div class="bg-slate-950/80 p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
                                    <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-[11px] block"><i class="fa-solid fa-square-root-variable mr-1"></i> Penyelesaian:</span>
                                    
                                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-[11px]">Cari diagonal bidang \(AC\):</p>
                                    <div class="font-mono text-slate-200 text-xs text-center bg-slate-900 p-2.5 rounded border border-slate-800">
                                        \(AC = \sqrt{AB^2 + BC^2} = \sqrt{6^2 + 6^2} = 6\sqrt{2}\)
                                    </div>

                                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-[11px] pt-1">Kemudian pada segitiga \(ACG\):</p>
                                    <div class="font-mono text-slate-200 text-xs text-center bg-slate-900 p-2.5 rounded border border-slate-800 space-y-1">
                                        <p>\(AG = \sqrt{AC^2 + CG^2}\)</p>
